# WaveAssist Dashboard Design Guidelines

IMPORTANT: Always use the latest design guidelines and color palette, do not use any old design or any other colors.

## Typography

- **UI Font:** Inter (imported from Google Fonts)
- **Headings:**
  - Weight: Bold (700) for H1, Semi-Bold (600) for H2-H6
  - Letter-spacing: -0.02em
  - Color: #FFFFFF
- **Body Text:**
  - Weight: Regular (400)
  - Standard spacing
  - Primary: #FFFFFF
  - Secondary: #A1A1AA

## Color Palette

### Background Colors

- **Main Background:** #0F1116
- **Section Background (Alternate):** #16181F
- **Card/Panel Background:** #1C1F28
- **Navbar Background:** #16181F
- **Sidebar Background:** #16181F

### Border Colors

- **Primary Border:** #2D313A (always use 1px thickness)
- **Border Radius:**
  - Buttons: 6px
  - Cards: 8px-12px

### Action Colors

- **Primary Action:** #1ED66C (Bright Green)
- **Primary Hover:** #148F47
- **Pro Accent:** #FBB040 (Yellow - for premium features)

### Text Colors

- **Primary Text:** #FFFFFF (White)
- **Secondary Text:** #A1A1AA (Cool Gray)
- **Text on Primary Button:** #000000 (Black)

## UI Elements

### Primary Button

```css
background-color: #1ed66c;
color: #000000;
border: none;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
font-weight: 400;
transition: all 0.2s ease;
```

**Hover State:**

```css
background-color: #148f47;
box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(30, 214, 108, 0.15);
```

### Secondary Button

```css
background-color: transparent;
color: #ffffff;
border: 1px solid #2d313a;
border-radius: 6px;
padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
font-weight: 400;
transition: all 0.2s ease;
```

**Hover State:**

```css
background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
```

### Active State/Glow

Use on active nodes, selected items, or main CTAs:

```css
box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(30, 214, 108, 0.15);
```

### Cards

```css
background-color: #1c1f28;
border: 1px solid #2d313a;
border-radius: 8px;
padding: 1.5rem;
```

**Card Hover (if interactive):**

```css
box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(30, 214, 108, 0.15);
border-color: #1ed66c;
```

## Background Pattern

All main sections should include a subtle background pattern overlay:

```css
background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
background-size: 24px 24px;
opacity: 0.4;
```

Implementation:

- Applied globally to `body` via `::before` pseudo-element
- Position: fixed, z-index: -10
- Use `.bg-pattern` class for section-specific patterns

## Textures & Gradients

### Background Pattern Implementation

- Pattern: `radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px)`
- Spacing: 24px
- Opacity: 40%
- Position: Absolutely positioned with z-index: -10

### Text Gradient (H1 Headers Only)

```css
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff, #a1a1aa);
-webkit-background-clip: text;
-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
background-clip: text;
```

## Form Elements

### Input Fields

```css
background-color: #1c1f28;
border: 1px solid #2d313a;
border-radius: 8px;
color: #ffffff;
padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
```

**Focus State:**

```css
border-color: #1ed66c;
box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.2rem rgba(30, 214, 108, 0.25);
```

**Placeholder:**

```css
color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
```

### Select/Dropdown

Same styling as input fields. Dropdown menu:

```css
background-color: #1c1f28;
border: 1px solid #2d313a;
```

## Modals

### Modal Styling

```css
.modal-body,
.modal-header,
.modal-footer {
	background-color: #1c1f28;
	border-color: #2d313a;
	color: #ffffff;
}
```

### Modal Title

```css
color: #ffffff;
font-weight: 600;
letter-spacing: -0.02em;
```

## Navigation

### Sidebar Active Link

```css
background-color: #1ed66c;
color: #000000;
font-weight: 500;
```

### Navbar

- Background: #16181F
- Border-bottom: 1px solid #2D313A
- Height: 60px

## AG Grid Theme

- Background: #0F1116
- Header Background: #16181F
- Cell Background: #0F1116
- Border: #2D313A
- Accent Color: #1ED66C
- Font: Inter

## Badges

### Primary Badge

```css
background-color: #1ed66c;
color: #000000;
```

### Secondary Badge

```css
background-color: #1c1f28;
border: 1px solid #2d313a;
color: #ffffff;
```

## Important Notes

1. **Never use old colors:**

   - ❌ #141721, #1A2430, #232F42, #428d4f, #28a745
   - ✅ Use new palette: #0F1116, #16181F, #1C1F28, #1ED66C

2. **Button Text Color:**

   - Primary buttons: #000000 (black text)
   - Secondary buttons: #FFFFFF (white text)

3. **Borders:**

   - Always 1px solid #2D313A
   - Never use thicker borders or different colors

4. **Background Pattern:**

   - Applied globally, no need to add manually to each component
   - Use `.bg-pattern` class only for section-specific overlays

5. **Font Family:**

   - Always use Inter, never Open Sans or other fonts
   - Import: `@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');`

6. **Remove Decorative SVGs:**

   - Remove all decorative BackgroundSVGs (TopRightSVG, BottomLeftSVG, curved circles, decorative shapes)
   - Keep only functional patterns

7. **Section Backgrounds:**
   - Main sections: `background-color: #0F1116`
   - Alternate sections: `background-color: #16181F`
   - Always add pattern overlay for consistency

## Design System File

All design system variables and utilities are defined in:
`/src/utils/design-system.css`

Use CSS variables from this file when possible:

- `var(--color-primary)` for #1ED66C
- `var(--color-bg-main)` for #0F1116
- `var(--color-bg-card)` for #1C1F28
- etc.

## Component-Specific Guidelines

### Login Page

- Background: #0F1116
- Card: #1C1F28 with #2D313A border
- Primary button: #1ED66C with black text

### Assistant Component

- Container: #0F1116
- Status Card: #1C1F28 with #2D313A border
- Config Card: #1C1F28 with #2D313A border
- Deploy Button: #1ED66C with black text

### Credits Component

- Container: #0F1116
- Cards: #1C1F28 with #2D313A border
- Total amount: #1ED66C color

### Project Cards

- Background: #1C1F28
- Border: #2D313A
- Hover: Green glow effect with border-color: #1ED66C

## Code Examples

### Creating a Primary Button

```tsx
<Button className="btn-primary">Click Me</Button>
```

Bootstrap's `.btn-primary` is already styled to match design system.

### Creating a Card

```tsx
<div className="card-wa">{/* Card content */}</div>
```

Or manually:

```css
.card {
	background-color: #1c1f28;
	border: 1px solid #2d313a;
	border-radius: 8px;
	padding: 1.5rem;
}
```

### Creating a Section with Pattern

```tsx
<section className="bg-main bg-pattern">{/* Section content */}</section>
```

## Testing Checklist

When adding new components, ensure:

- [ ] Uses Inter font
- [ ] Uses correct color palette (no old colors)
- [ ] Primary buttons have black text
- [ ] Cards have #1C1F28 background and #2D313A border
- [ ] Borders are 1px solid #2D313A
- [ ] Hover states include green glow for primary actions
- [ ] Form inputs have correct focus states
- [ ] Text colors match guidelines (#FFFFFF primary, #A1A1AA secondary)
